{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026BujekxUrxp1793574012.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>比亞迪上月新能源車銷量按年和按月都錄得升幅。</p><p></p><p>10月銷量按年增長近一成一，至49萬輛，按月上升逾半成。期內，新能源車出口逾17萬輛，按月下跌百分之5.8。總計首10個月，新能源車銷量逾362萬輛，按年下跌百分之2.1。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:43.353225+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T22:46:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T03:38:07.692485+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T00:41:43.432185+00:00","content_hash":"edeb481a1794e7efd66ad585468fada67d122585704b4772c08b0a6d1bc470a8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:43.353225+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}